[node name="Devour" type="Node"]
editor_description = "The Devour effect (ifna) of the Netherfiend and the Hellmouth. AbilitySlot instances it as \"Effect\" from the effect field of its AbilityType (data/catalog/abilities/). It prepares the shoot1 clip (72 and 92 ticks), accepts a blue NORMAL or EMERGING soul within the length of the box (2D), eats it (Soul.begin_devour), grows (DevourGrowth) and heals 600 (Rainbow). Mana 0, no cooldown."
